# Agent configuration, worktrees, notes, reports, and internal plans.
# scripts/ and .agents/skills/perf-benchmark/ are tracked on purpose: CI
# fetches the reference corpus through them and the benchmark methodology is
# part of the repo. orca-cli stays local, synced via skills-lock.json.
/.claude/
/.agents/*
!/.agents/skills/
/.agents/skills/orca-cli/
/.opencode/
/opencode.json
/.qwen/
/.gemini/
/.cursor/
/.agent_reports/
/notes.txt
/AUDIT.md
/plan_*.md
/skills-lock.json
